<view class="screen {{theme}}"><mm-header back="{{false}}" bindback="back"/><view class="content"><mm-state busy="{{busy}}" error="{{error}}" bindretry="retry"/><view class="eyebrow">MUSICMIRROR / 我的镜像</view><view class="title">我的音乐审美</view><view wx:if="{{account.mode==='mock'}}" class="badge">演示账号 · 合成数据</view><view wx:if="{{hasRun}}" class="note" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/run/index">上次的分析可以继续查看 →</view><view wx:if="{{empty}}" class="card"><mm-chart kind="prism"/><view class="heading">从两种选择开始</view><view class="muted">连接已有听歌资料，选定想观察的红心作品。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/inputs/index">配置输入并分析</button></view><block wx:if="{{report}}"><view class="caption">采集于 {{report.collected}}<view></view>{{report.version}}</view><view class="card"><mm-chart kind="prism"/><view class="heading">长期行为 × 主动选择</view><view class="grid"><view><view class="big">{{report.longCount}}</view><view class="muted">长期样本 / 次数加权</view></view><view><view class="big">{{report.heartCount}}</view><view class="muted">选定红心 / 歌曲等权</view></view></view><view class="caption">{{report.heartWindow}}</view></view><view wx:for="{{report.insights}}" wx:key="id" class="card accent"><view>{{item.title}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{report.legacy}}" class="note">这是一份历史旧版报告。刷新后使用12类审美卡片。</view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="go" data-tab="true" data-url="/pages/explore/index">探索全部审美卡片</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/structure/index">我的长期结构</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/preferences/index">我的主动偏好</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/inputs/index">管理两类输入</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/run/index?start=1">刷新我的镜像</button></view></block></view></view>
